Do not retry a mutation after an ambiguous RPC result.

The harness journals one mutation per invocation. Repeating Put can apply the
same logical write on both sides of another writer, and repeating a successful
CAS after losing its reply can return false. Retain lookup and read retries,
but expose the first mutation RPC result to the harness as success or unknown.

